    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            

<p>Sipariş--İrsaliye den dönüşmüş fatura da sipariş ve irsaliye ile ilgili xml de bilgileri gözükmüyor. Efaturada örnek xml de aşağıdaki elementler bulunuyor.</p>

<div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="codeContent panelContent">
<pre class="code-html"><span class="code-tag">&lt;cac:OrderReference&gt;</span>
    <span class="code-tag">&lt;cbc:ID&gt;</span>Y_K5618_02_0518<span class="code-tag">&lt;/cbc:ID&gt;</span>
    <span class="code-tag">&lt;cbc:IssueDate&gt;</span>2026-06-05<span class="code-tag">&lt;/cbc:IssueDate&gt;</span>
  <span class="code-tag">&lt;/cac:OrderReference&gt;</span>

  <span class="code-tag">&lt;cac:DespatchDocumentReference&gt;</span>
    <span class="code-tag">&lt;cbc:ID&gt;</span>IDI2026000000696<span class="code-tag">&lt;/cbc:ID&gt;</span>
    <span class="code-tag">&lt;cbc:IssueDate&gt;</span>2026-06-05<span class="code-tag">&lt;/cbc:IssueDate&gt;</span>
  <span class="code-tag">&lt;/cac:DespatchDocumentReference&gt;</span></pre>
</div></div>

<p>Siparişler için e-faturada bu iki fn den geldiğini hatırlıyorum. SELECT <span class="error">&#91;dbo&#93;</span>.fn_Fat_SiparisTarihler(ID),<span class="error">&#91;dbo&#93;</span>.fn_Fat_SiparisNolar(ID) FROM FATBASLIK WHERE ID = 1612</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://gentegre.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12977" alt="image-20260824-114526.png" width="742" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

